      "source_sha256": "4a97161accdaf67cd4b507ce1bfd43a594f646638a7c102c67fd75a9b332e1b7",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "护国节度使安彦威、匡国节度使安重霸皆降，"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "218f69d6-c532-5d8a-b0ea-a1459988f1cc",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/d4437e45/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-04/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-weizhou/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-04/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-weizhou/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "1a6807f0fc0ff77d0991a7f8321877b9f0d9143c03707508a989b3e9cc6b915e",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "弓箭库使沙守荣、奔洪进前责敬瑭曰：“公明宗爱婿，富贵相与共之，忧患亦宜相恤。今天子播越，委计于公，冀图兴复，乃以此四者为辞，是直欲附贼卖天子耳！”"
    },
